doctype html
html(lang="en")
  head
    meta(charset="UTF-8")
    meta(name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
    title Reviewer Invitation
  body(style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height:1.6;")
    h2 Hello #{name},

    p You have been invited to join as a 
      strong Reviewer 
      |  for the DBA Conference.

    p Please click the button below to set your password and activate your account:

    a(
      href=link
      style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 20px;background:#003366;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;margin:10px 0;"
    ) Set Your Password

    p If the button does not work, copy and paste this link into your browser:

    p
      | #{link}

    p This link will expire in 24 hours.

    br
    p Regards,
    p DBA Conference Team